nk it was a bit too ordinary.","jump":"m_ex_sora_01_29"},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_26","text":"Hehe, I'm glad you liked it! ♥","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_27","text":"From the moment I first saw you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_28","text":"I could tell you'd appreciate this type of thing. ★","jump":"m_ex_sora_01_33"},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_29","text":"Oh, really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_30","text":"I thought that'd be what you were into,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_31","text":"but I guess I was wrong. ★","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_32","text":"I will try something a bit more innovative next time. ♥","jump":"m_ex_sora_01_33"},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_33","text":"Aw, darn. ★","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_34","text":"My squadmates are here,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_35","text":"and","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_36","text":"they keep interrupting me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_37","text":"I think","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_38","text":"it's because","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_39","text":"they're curious","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_40","text":"about what I'm texting you, Captain.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_41","text":"Haha, oh boy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_42","text":"This won't do. ★","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_43","text":"Give me just a moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_44","text":"Hehe,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_45","text":"I'll take care of this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_46","text":"Haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sora_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"sora","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sora_01_47","text":"Talk to you again soon! ♥","jump":null}],"chat":true}